# Output of `pnpm build:sidecar` (scripts/omp-sidecar.mjs). The sidecar is a
# ~280 MB self-contained executable plus its provenance manifest; both are
# build products, produced from the pinned OMP fork checkout and recorded in
# docs/validation/M5-bundled-sidecar.md, and neither is committed.
#
# `extensions/omp-desktop-gate.ts` is copied here by the same build so the
# packaged app loads the gate from Resources rather than from a source tree;
# the tracked copy lives in packages/omp-runtime/extensions/.
omp
omp.exe
provenance.json
extensions/
